  "term_and_condition": "<div style=\"font-family:Jost;\"><h2><strong>BuyPhones Partner Program – Terms &amp; Conditions</strong></h2><p><strong>Last updated:</strong> October 2025</p><p>Welcome to the BuyPhones Partner Program! By signing up to become an affiliate (“Partner”) of <strong>BuyPhones.site</strong>, you agree to comply with the following Terms and Conditions. Please read them carefully before joining.</p><hr><h3><strong>1. Enrollment</strong></h3><p>To join the program, submit a complete application through our Partner Portal. We reserve the right to approve or reject any application at our discretion. Applications that promote hate, illegal activity, or misleading content will not be accepted.</p><hr><h3><strong>2. Partner Responsibilities</strong></h3><ul><li><p>You may promote BuyPhones products (chargers, screen protectors, pouches, phone cases, etc.) through your website, social media, or other approved channels.</p></li><li><p>You must not use false, misleading, or deceptive claims when promoting our products.</p></li><li><p>You are responsible for ensuring your promotional content complies with all advertising, data, and privacy laws.</p></li><li><p>Coupon or discount code misuse, spamming, or cookie stuffing is strictly prohibited.</p></li></ul><hr><h3><strong>3. Commissions &amp; Payments</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Partners earn commissions on <strong>valid sales</strong> made through their unique referral link or coupon code.</p></li><li><p>Commissions are calculated based on the <strong>net order value</strong> (excluding taxes, shipping, and refunds).</p></li><li><p>Payments are issued according to our standard payout schedule.</p></li><li><p>Orders that are canceled, refunded, or flagged for fraud will not qualify for commission.</p></li></ul><hr><h3><strong>4. Branding &amp; Intellectual Property</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Partners may use official <strong>BuyPhones logos, images, and product descriptions</strong> available in our affiliate resources.</p></li><li><p>You may <strong>not</strong> alter our branding, create duplicate websites, or represent yourself as an employee or agent of BuyPhones.</p></li><li><p>All brand materials remain the property of BuyPhones.</p></li></ul><hr><h3><strong>5. Termination</strong></h3><p>BuyPhones reserves the right to suspend or terminate your participation at any time, without notice, if you:</p><ul><li><p>Violate these Terms &amp; Conditions</p></li><li><p>Engage in unethical or fraudulent activity</p></li><li><p>Misuse brand assets or harm our reputation</p></li></ul><p>Upon termination, all pending unpaid commissions may be forfeited.</p><hr><h3><strong>6. Program Changes</strong></h3><p>BuyPhones may modify the Partner Program, its commission rates, or these Terms &amp; Conditions at any time, with or without notice. Continued participation after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.</p><hr><h3><strong>7. Limitation of Liability</strong></h3><p>BuyPhones is not responsible for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages (such as loss of revenue or profits) arising from your participation in the program.</p><hr><h3><strong>8. Governing Law</strong></h3><p>These Terms &amp; Conditions are governed by the laws of <strong>South Africa</strong>. Any disputes will be handled under South African law.</p><hr><p><strong>By joining the BuyPhones Partner Program, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agreed to these Terms &amp; Conditions.</strong></p></div>",
